<title>USA: Town &amp; Country sees fourth quarter shr loss.</title>
<headline>Town &amp; Country sees fourth quarter shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHELSEA, Mass. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Town &amp; Country Co said Tuesday its preliminary results for the fiscal fourth quarter showed a net loss of $13.8 million and a net loss per common share of $0.54, versus a net loss of $3.8 million or $0.17 per share in the year-earlier period, as the company restructured its operational process.</p>
<p>The company said preliminary results for fiscal 1997 showed a net loss of $62.3 million compared with a net loss of $1.9 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
</text>
